Motif was originally developed by the Open Software Foundation, from
contributions by Digital Equipment Corporation, Hewlett-Packard and
others, and is copyright The Open Group.  Integrated Computer Solutions
(ICS) maintained Motif 2.3 and released it under the LGPL in 2012.  The
git history records the individual changes since then.

